{
  "key": "letter-206-part-01",
  "number": 206,
  "generationId": "01a1e8ee-2e14-7185-8846-05dff4ea5540",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.642222
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "To be religious is to be a yea-sayer: yes to everything - yes to life and yes to death, yes to light and yes to darkness.",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.7895690000000002,
      "end": 8.336621
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Total acceptance is religion.",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/03.mp3",
      "start": 9.544580000000002,
      "end": 11.22322
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Says Nicolas De Cusa: Yes God!",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/04.mp3",
      "start": 12.425397,
      "end": 14.672381
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Yes God!",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/05.mp3",
      "start": 15.850136000000001,
      "end": 16.652177000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Yes, yes and always yes.",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/06.mp3",
      "start": 17.809773,
      "end": 19.239637000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Say yes - and feel it, and you have entered the temple of the divine.",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/07.mp3",
      "start": 20.377755,
      "end": 23.82551
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Say no and you yourself have closed the doors - or closed yourself to the divine.",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/08.mp3",
      "start": 25.371156,
      "end": 31.073175000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "No is suicidal, no is poisonous - know this and be a yea-sayer.",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/09.mp3",
      "start": 32.522132,
      "end": 37.848865999999994
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Let your heart say yes with every beat.",
      "path": "audio/1971-206/10.mp3",
      "start": 39.373175,
      "end": 42.29
    }
  ]
}
